# 📉 Customer Churn Prediction — MLOps Pipeline

> End-to-end production ML pipeline for predicting customer churn — from raw data to a live API with automated drift detection. Built with the same tooling used in industry: **MLflow experiment tracking, model registry, FastAPI serving, Docker, and automated retraining alerts**.

